  // oklch chroma is ~0–0.4 in sRGB gamut; >= 0.02 reads as tinted, not gray.
  // lch chroma is ~0–150; >= 3 reads as tinted. jsdom emits both formats
  // literally (it does NOT convert them to rgb).
