| -------- | ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| 401      | Bad API key      | Check key or re-setup                          |
| 402      | No credits       | Top up at transcriptapi.com/billing            |
| 403/1010 | Cloudflare block | Add or fix User-Agent header                   |
