   - Implemented `calculate_syllable_budget(start_s, end_s, rate=3.2)` calculating target budget ($S_{target} = \max(1, \text{round}(\Delta t \times 3.2))$) and strict upper ceiling ($S_{max} = \max(1, \text{round}(\Delta t \times 3.6))$).
